#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:349
msgid ""
"Tailscale is a mesh VPN solution that makes it easy to connect your devices "
"securely. This configuration page allows you to manage Tailscale settings on "
"your OpenWrt device."
msgstr ""
"Tailscale — это mesh VPN-решение, которое упрощает безопасное подключение "
"ваших устройств. Эта страница конфигурации позволяет управлять настройками "
"Tailscale на вашем устройстве OpenWRT."

#: applications/luci-app-tailscale-community/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/tailscale.js:248
